        "user": "Ornithopod",
        "daysAgo": 9,
        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "{{true and funny|source=https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2022/sep/13/oh-god-i-hate-this-king-charles-expresses-frustration-over-leaking-pen}}\n'''Charles III''' acceded on 8 September 2022. On 13 September 2022, at Hillsborough Castle, a pen leaked, and an aide told him the date was 13 September, not 12 September. The Sword of Offering was later redeemed with 100 newly minted 50p coins."
