        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "{{true and funny|source=https://www.cbsnews.com/news/happy-hour-at-the-white-house/}}\n'''Barack Obama''' drank Bud Light in the Rose Garden on 30 July 2009. Joe Biden drank Buckler. Josh Earnest later said the president stood behind a summer suit worn on 28 August 2014."
