        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "{{true and funny|source=https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/jd-vance-couch-cushions/}}\n'''JD Vance''' is the 50th vice president, sworn on 20 January 2025. Snopes says pages 179–181 of Hillbilly Elegy do not contain the passage a post assigned to them that July. His Lenox vase showed the Capitol."
