        "content": "{{true and funny|source=Variety, 25 November 2025: Gary De’Snake is a goofy blue pit viper with a faint lisp and superfast lasso skills, which come in handy for a creature without hands.}}\n{{Infobox\n| title = Zootopia 2\n| studio = Walt Disney Animation Studios\n| directors = Jared Bush and Byron Howard\n| screenplay = Jared Bush\n| producer = Yvett Merino\n| us release = 26 November 2025\n| rating = PG\n| runtime = 1 hour 48 minutes\n| worldwide gross, page opened 8 October 2026 = $1,870,309,291\n| budget on that page = $150,000,000\n}}\n\n'''Zootopia 2''' is an animated film from Walt Disney Animation Studios. Disney's film page lists a United States theatrical release of 26 November 2025, directors Jared Bush and Byron Howard, a screenplay by Jared Bush, and producer Yvett Merino. The same page lists the rating as PG, the runtime as 1 hour 48 minutes, and the genres as adventure, animation, and comedy.<ref name=\"disney-facts\">Disney Movies, \"Zootopia 2\", page opened 8 October 2026. https://movies.disney.com/zootopia-2</ref> As of October 2026, that page also lists the film as a 2026 Academy Award nominee for Animated Feature Film, and as a 2026 Golden Globe nominee for Best Motion Picture – Animated and for Cinematic and Box Office Achievement.<ref name=\"disney-noms\">Disney Movies, \"Zootopia 2\", nominations as printed on the page opened 8 October 2026. https://movies.disney.com/zootopia-2</ref>\n\nVariety's review is dated 25 November 2025, the day before the United States theatrical date on Disney's page. It spends a paragraph on a snake.\n\n== Release and running time ==\nBox Office Mojo, opened on 8 October 2026, lists the earliest release as 26 November 2025, in 16 markets. It lists the MPAA rating as PG and the running time as 1 hour 48 minutes.<ref name=\"bom-time\">Box Office Mojo, \"Zootopia 2\", page opened 8 October 2026. https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt26443597/</ref> Variety's review, dated 25 November 2025, gives the running time as 108 minutes.<ref name=\"var-time\">''Variety'', review of ''Zootopia 2'', 25 November 2025, running time 108 minutes. https://variety.com/2025/film/reviews/zootopia-2-review-disney-1236587603/</ref>\n\nOne hour and 48 minutes is 108 minutes. The two pages are using the same length.\n\nThe review was filed from a screening at the Samuel Goldwyn Theater in Los Angeles on 15 November 2025, eleven days before the 26 November date on Disney's page.<ref name=\"var-screen\">''Variety'', 25 November 2025, screening at the Samuel Goldwyn Theater, Los Angeles, 15 November 2025. https://variety.com/2025/film/reviews/zootopia-2-review-disney-1236587603/</ref>\n\n== Voices ==\nDisney's page says the returning leads are Judy Hopps, voiced by Ginnifer Goodwin, and Nick Wilde, voiced by Jason Bateman. The new character Gary De’Snake is voiced by Ke Huy Quan. The page's line is that Gary \"arrives in Zootopia and turns the animal metropolis upside down.\"<ref name=\"disney-gary\">Disney Movies, \"Zootopia 2\", Gary De’Snake and the returning leads, page opened 8 October 2026. https://movies.disney.com/zootopia-2</ref>\n\nOther voices named on that page include Fortune Feimster as Nibbles, Quinta Brunson as the therapist Dr. Fuzzby, Patrick Warburton as Mayor Winddancer, and Yvette Nicole Brown as the Bearoness. Disney calls Dr. Fuzzby \"an adorable quokka\" and says Nick and Judy go to her \"to help them sort out a few issues in their partnership.\" The voice list on the page also includes Shakira, Idris Elba, Andy Samberg, and Macaulay Culkin.<ref name=\"disney-voices\">Disney Movies, \"Zootopia 2\", additional voices, page opened 8 October 2026. https://movies.disney.com/zootopia-2</ref>\n\n== What the company said in December ==\nOn 1 December 2025, five days after the United States date, The Walt Disney Company said the sequel \"picks up directly after the conclusion of the first film,\" with Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde, and that Bush directs alongside Byron Howard. The same post says Bush was named chief creative officer of Walt Disney Animation Studios in September 2024.<ref name=\"twdc\">The Walt Disney Company, \"Jared Bush Zootopia 2\", 1 December 2025. https://thewaltdisneycompany.com/news/jared-bush-zootopia-2/</ref>\n\nThe September 2024 job and the November 2025 film are two dates in one paragraph. The post is about both.\n\n== The review ==\nVariety's notice of Gary De’Snake is specific. The sentence is: \"The film's most endearing addition is Gary De’Snake (Ke Huy Quan), a goofy blue pit viper with a faint lisp and superfast lasso skills (which come in handy for a creature without hands).\"<ref name=\"var-gary\">''Variety'', 25 November 2025, Gary De’Snake. https://variety.com/2025/film/reviews/zootopia-2-review-disney-1236587603/</ref> The lasso is in the review because the character, as described there, has no hands.\n\nThe same review says the gala includes a new Shakira song, \"Zoo,\" performed as Gazelle. It also notes a DVD pirate \"selling furry takes on Disney titles.\"<ref name=\"var-zoo\">''Variety'', 25 November 2025, the song \"Zoo\" and the DVD pirate. https://variety.com/2025/film/reviews/zootopia-2-review-disney-1236587603/</ref> The review places that note next to the song.\n\n== The gross on 8 October 2026 ==\nAs of October 2026, the Box Office Mojo page opened on 8 October listed these figures:<ref name=\"bom-gross\">Box Office Mojo, \"Zootopia 2\", grosses, page opened 8 October 2026. https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt26443597/</ref>\n\n{| class=\"wikitable\"\n|+ Box Office Mojo, opened 8 October 2026\n! Line !! Amount\n|-\n| Worldwide || $1,870,309,291\n|-\n| Domestic || $428,130,160\n|-\n| International || $1,442,179,131\n|-\n| Domestic opening || $100,262,540\n|-\n| China || $651,398,000\n|-\n| Budget || $150,000,000\n|}\n\nThe China line on that page is $651,398,000. The domestic line on that page is $428,130,160. The budget line is $150,000,000. The page printed a worldwide total of $1,870,309,291.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n\n[[Category:Films]]\n[[Category:True but improbable]]\n"
