        "content": "'''Bruce Willis''' is an American actor, born Walter Bruce Willis on 19 March 1955. He played John McClane in Die Hard. In 2022 his family said he was stepping away from acting after an aphasia diagnosis.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
