        "content": "'''Christopher Nolan''' is a film director, born 30 July 1970 in London. He won the Academy Award for Best Director for Oppenheimer on 10 March 2024. He told Collider the film has no CGI shots.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
