      "content": "== The alien suit ==\nEvery other write-up has him in an alien suit. Why is that not in the article? ~~~\n\n: Because it is not on a page we opened. The 16 August 2019 Rolling Stone profile documents the bowl cut and the monster truck in the \"All That x Alien Boy\" video. Biography.com (15 June 2026) documents Ugly Is Beautiful, the Atlantic signing, and the death on 14 June 2026. An alien suit is not described on those pages, so it is not in the article. [[User:HansardHannah|HansardHannah]] ([[User talk:HansardHannah|talk]]) 18:05, 7 October 2026 (UTC)\n"
