        "daysAgo": 9,
        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "{{true and funny|source=https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/12/lindsey-graham-obituary}}\n'''Lindsey Olin Graham''' was born on 9 July 1955 and died on 11 July 2026. The BBC reported that his office called it a “brief and sudden illness.” In 2016 he said an election-year Supreme Court nomination should not be considered, and said people could use those words against him."
