        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "'''Keanu Reeves''' is an actor, born Keanu Charles Reeves on 2 September 1964 in Beirut. He played Neo in The Matrix and co-founded Arch Motorcycle Company in 2011.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
