        "content": "'''Tom Cruise''' is an American actor, born Thomas Cruise Mapother IV on 3 July 1962 in Syracuse, New York. He plays Ethan Hunt in Mission: Impossible and returned as Maverick in Top Gun: Maverick (2022).\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
