      "content": "== Citizenship ==\nThe lead should say she is an Albanian citizen. That has been reported for years. ~~~\n\n: Not from a page this article can cite. The government page that did open is the presidency of Kosovo, 10 August 2016: President Hashim Thaçi awarded the Presidential Medal of Merits in Prishtina. Britannica, updated 6 October 2026, says her parents fled Kosovo in 1992 and calls her British-Albanian. An Albanian citizenship decree was not on a page we opened, so the article does not state one. [[User:HansardHannah|HansardHannah]] ([[User talk:HansardHannah|talk]]) 09:18, 7 October 2026 (UTC)\n"
