        "content": "'''Wuthering Heights''' (2026) is a film written and directed by Emerald Fennell. Warner Bros. put it in U.S. theaters on 13 February 2026. The running time on the home-entertainment notice is 136 minutes.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
