        "content": "'''Wake Up Dead Man''' is the third Benoit Blanc film, written and directed by Rian Johnson. Variety dated a two-week theatrical run from 26 November 2025, then Netflix on 12 December 2025.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
