      "content": "== Where is the link ==\nReaders keep asking for the address. The article does not have one. ~~~\n\n: The sources on this page are the indictment PDF and the FY2023 PRO IP Act report, both on justice.gov. The report says the network of domains was taken offline and seized under a court order on 3 November 2022. It does not publish a current address, and this article will not add one. The FY2023 report, running through 30 September 2023, restates the charges, the Argentina arrests and the seizure, and does not record a plea, an extradition to the United States, a conviction or a sentence. A justice.gov search on 8 October 2026 did not surface a later department release disposing of the case. [[User:CiteOrDie|CiteOrDie]] ([[User talk:CiteOrDie|talk]]) 15:36, 8 October 2026 (UTC)\n"
