      "content": "== 30 December or 31 December ==\nThe custody section has two dates for the same jail. ~~~\n\n: The day is contested in the sources opened here. ABC News, 14 February 2019, dates the escape from the Garfield County Jail in Glenwood Springs to 30 December 1977. United Press International, 24 January 1989, dates it 31 December 1977. Both name that jail. The article does not describe a method, and it does not describe the crimes. https://www.upi.com/Archives/1989/01/24/A-chronology-of-events-leading-to-Ted-Bundys-execution/4811601621200/ [[User:CiteOrDie|CiteOrDie]] ([[User talk:CiteOrDie|talk]]) 12:18, 7 October 2026 (UTC)\n"
